cff-version: 1.2.0
message: If you use spectrace, please cite it as below.
title: spectrace
abstract: >
  Reproducible bake-off harness for measuring speculative decoding and other
  serving tricks on multi-step agent traces (not ShareGPT chat). Reports wall
  latency, draft accept rate, tokens, cost per successful task, and failure modes.
type: software
